  "recommendation": "If you specifically want a fixed points or cash-back bonus, the EcoCard is the clearest documented option. If you expect substantial spending during the first nine months, the Silver Zoom triple-cash-back promotion could be more valuable, but its exact value depends on its standard cash-back rate and your spending.",
  "next_step": "Tell me whether you want a personal or business card and roughly how much you could spend in the first month. I can then narrow this to the best fit."
